  "fullDescription": "Evoke nostalgia with a contemporary twist using the Remember Christmas font.\n\nThis hollow, “bubble-outline” Remember Christmas typeface provides a friendly and open aesthetic that is perfect for coloring-book-style designs, youthful branding, and festive headers. Because of its clean outlines, the Remember Christmas font is incredibly versatile; you can fill the letters with patterns, gradients, or solid colors to match your theme.\n\nThe Remember Christmas typeface works wonderfully on large-scale prints like banners and apparel, where readability and personality are equally important. It is the go-to choice for a “modern retro” holiday vibe.",
